+  "- 砍掉\"不是A而是B\"及变体（不是…是…/与其说…不如说…/并非…而是…）：删否定前半句，直接陈述。（仅限叙述层；对白里口语的「不是…就是…」「不是说…」是正常说话，别动。）\\n": "- Cut off \"not A but B\" and its variations (not...is.../rather than.../not...but...): delete the first half of the negative sentence and state it directly. (Only for the narrative level; the spoken words \"either...it's...\" and \"I'm not saying...\" spoken in dialogue are normal speech, don't move.) \\n",
+  "- 删 AI 套路应激模板与 DeepSeek 高频部位词（指节泛白、弧度、指尖、嘴角、睫毛、喉结、纽扣、呼吸一滞、倒吸一口凉气、一丝 / 一抹 / 一些 / 一种、不易察觉、四肢百骸、如遭雷击、大脑空白、心如刀绞）：换成具体可见的动作或不写。\\n": "- Delete the AI routine stress template and DeepSeek high-frequency part words (white knuckles, curvature, fingertips, corners of the mouth, eyelashes, Adam's apple, buttons, stagnant breathing, a gasp of cold air, a trace / a touch / some / a kind, difficult to detect, limbs and bones, like being struck by lightning, brain blank, heart wrenching): replace them with specific visible actions or do not write them. \\n",
