+  "内置分两段——第二段仅在所需依据（角色卡 / 前文 / 世界书）在场时附加；": "Built in two sections - the second section is only appended when the required basis (character card/previous text/World Info) is present;",
+  "自定义后整份恒发（勾上该目标就发你这份全文）。不勾选则不发送。": "After customizing, the entire text will be sent to you (check this target and the full text will be sent to you). If not checked, it will not be sent.",
