+  "轻校是自动校正的默认档。注意保留输出格式要求（<FixedReply> / <problems> 区块）——丢了它们，校正结果将无法被解析应用。": "Light correction is the default setting for automatic correction. Note that the output format requirements (<FixedReply> / <problems> blocks) are preserved - without them, the correction results cannot be parsed and applied.",
+  "自动校正 · 精校 ✨": "Automatic calibration · Fine calibration ✨",
