+  "【序列状态行（系统协议）】\n你每条正文的最末尾必须原样输出一行状态标签，报告上方剧情推进指令中当前目标的落实情况：\n<so_seq>拍={{BEAT}} 码={{NONCE}} 状态=进行中</so_seq>\n仅当该目标已在你本次回复的正文中完整发生（不是计划、预告、回忆或对话提及）时，改报：\n<so_seq>拍={{BEAT}} 码={{NONCE}} 状态=已达成 证据=「逐字摘自本次正文中能证明它的一句原话」</so_seq>\n规则：标签每次只出现一次、贴正文最末；拍与码原样照抄；这行是给引导系统读的锚点，请务必每次输出。\n码一变就是新目标：历史里旧码的状态标签不作数。本次只写到起始迹象或目标的一部分，仍是进行中。": "【 Sequence Status Line (System Protocol) 】\nAt the end of each text you must output a line of status labels as is, reporting the implementation of the current goals in the plot advancement instructions above:\n<so_seq>拍={{BEAT}} 码={{NONCE}} 状态=进行中</so_seq>\nOnly if the goal has fully occurred in the body of your reply (not planned, previewed, recalled, or mentioned in dialogue), change the report:\n<so_seq>拍={{BEAT}} 码={{NONCE}} 状态=已达成 证据=「a verbatim sentence from this reply that proves the goal occurred」</so_seq>\nRules: The label only appears once at a time, and the text is pasted last; copy the code as it is; this line is the anchor point for the guidance system to read, so please be sure to output it every time.\nOnce the code changes, it becomes the new target: the status tags of the old code in history do not count. This time I have only written part of the starting signs or goals, and it is still a work in progress.",
