+  "【用户节奏意图：还想继续】别急着收束——可以铺垫 / 升温 / 在重拍之间插入一个低赌注的喘息拍，把张力慢慢积累，这一拍不要逼近高潮。": "【 User Rhythm Intention: If you still want to continue 】, don’t rush to end - you can set the stage / heat up / insert a low-stakes breathing beat between the retakes to slowly build up the tension, and don’t approach the climax with this beat.",
