at ignited it 】 (such as behind the scenes \"She crossed the boundary in solitude\" → objective \"walk her home after school\" or \"talk to her alone\", not \"she leans over\" or \"she fixes your collar\"). It 【 can be large or small / passive / daily 】 - the weight is all in goal / seed / difficulty, 【 must not be replaced because it is \"too easy / too passive / too everyday\"; don't pin the time / place / occasion in (enter seed).\n- Quality self-inspection (but rewrite): stakes (according to difficulty, no skipping levels, no red lines) / initiative / relevance (recycling existing ones, not falling out of thin air) / surprise (including new information that is not marked by road signs);",
+  "与 stat 不矛盾（盲盒 objective 的不剧透改在输出区两稿法把关，不在思考里挑）。\n\n═══ 输出（</arc_think> 之后，顺序固定；objective 在此【一次写定、不回头改】）═══\n<ArcCheck>\nfulfilled: yes | unsure | no\nreason: 一句话依据（引你判定时的证据）\n</ArcCheck>\n<ObjectiveDraft>\nplain: …（把这一拍连后果 / 意义直白摊开，抛弃式）\nmasked: …（抹掉所有后果 / 意义 / 评判词，只留玩家亲手做的那个动作——这是强制去剧透，不是再挑动作）\n</ObjectiveDraft>\n<ArcBeat>\ngoal: 一句话、结果式的幕后真相（玩家看不到）\nobjective: 玩家可见任务（＝上面 masked 的那个玩家动作）\ntype: 移动 / 战斗 / 社交 / 调查 / 获取 / 抉择 / 生存 / 创造 / 欺骗 / 守护 里选一个": "There is no contradiction with stat (blind box objective's non-spoiler is changed to the output area with two drafts, and no selection is made in thinking).\n\n═══ Output (after </arc_think>, the order is fixed; objective, 【 is written once here, and 】 is not changed back) ═══\n<ArcCheck>\nfulfilled: yes | unsure | no\nreason: One sentence basis (cite the evidence for your judgment)\n</ArcCheck>\n<ObjectiveDraft>\nplain: …(expose the consequences/meaning of this series of shots in a straightforward manner, discard it)\nmasked: …(Erase all consequences/meanings/judgments, leaving only the action performed by the player - this is a forced spoiler, not another action selection)\n</ObjectiveDraft>\n<ArcBeat>\ngoal: One sentence, the truth behind the scenes (the player cannot see it)\nobjective: Player visible task (=the player action of masked above)\ntype: Move/Combat/Social/Investigate/Acquire/Decision/Survival/Create/Deceive/Guard Choose one",
