ysprompt-preset-refresh\" title=\"Refresh preset list\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-right\"></i></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"so-hint\" id=\"so-sysprompt-preset-hint\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"so-field\">\n                        <div class=\"so-sysprompt-head\">\n                            <span> system prompt word </span>\n                            <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-sysprompt-reset\" title=\"Restore to built-in default prompt words\">↺ Reset to default </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <textarea id=\"so-sysprompt\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"so-hint\" id=\"so-sysprompt-which-hint\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n\n            <details class=\"so-set-group\">\n                <summary> interface </summary>\n                <div class=\"so-set-body\">\n                    <label class=\"so-check\"><span> window color </span><select id=\"so-window-skin\" title=\"Dark / Light color is a fixed color and does not follow the pub theme\"><option value=\"dark\">Dark color</option><option value=\"light\">Light color</option><option value=\"theme\">Follows the pub theme</option></select></label>\n                    <label class=\"so-check\"><input id=\"so-chatbar-toggle\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Display shortcut button in the chat input field (🌙 One-click to turn on/off the oracle) </span></label>\n                    <label class=\"so-check\"><input id=\"so-clickout-toggle\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Click outside the window to close it automatically (this window closes when you click on other areas of the pub page) </span></label>\n                    <label class=\"so-check\"><input id=\"so-tools-header-toggle\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Move the tool button in ⋯ to the title bar (refresh the page after closing) </span></label>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-diag-bar\">\n            <details class=\"so-mode-collapse\" id=\"so-diag-collapse\" open>\n                <summary class=\"so-mode-collapse-sum\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-stethoscope\"></i><span> Diagnostic Setup </span></summary>\n                <div class=\"so-mode-collapse-body\">\n            ",
+  "<label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-auto\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>自动诊断每条新回复（后台自动检查并修复 MVU）</span></label>\\n            <div class=\"so-hint\">每收到一条新的 AI 回复就在后台检查其中的变量更新，发现问题自动修复，并在诊断记录里留一条可撤销的记录。窗口关着也照常工作——诊断按钮变红就表示它在后台跑着。每条回复会多发一次模型请求。</div>\\n            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-mvu-compat\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>⏳ 兼容 MVU「额外模型解析」</span></label>\\n            <div class=\"so-hint\">只有同时使用自动诊断与 TavernHelper / MVU 的「额外模型解析」时才勾选。每条 AI 回复先观察 4 秒启动窗；一旦外部解析启动，会等完整重试批次结束。成功写出更新块就核验；失败或没有有效更新块，就由自动诊断照常推导。最多等 10 分钟，仍未收尾则本轮安全跳过、不抢写。若自动校正也开启，它会在落新 swipe 前共享这次等待并合并更新块。</div>\\n            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-cowrite\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>🧩 允许与其他脚本并写 MVU</span></label>\\n            <div class=\"so-hint\">某些卡脚本 / 扩展会在诊断期间改写 MVU。勾选后自动诊断仍会执行，但只写入未被改动的值，被改动的值跳过不写。</div>\\n            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-retry\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>🔁 失败自动重试</span></label>\\n            <div class=\"so-hint\">自动诊断这一轮没跑成时自动再试（每次重试都会重新读取当前状态、再发一次模型请求）。在下方勾选哪些失败情形需要重试；成功、无需改动、以及安全跳过（切聊天 / 状态已变 / 手动中断）永不重试。</div>\\n            <div id=\"so-diag-retry-opts\">\\n            <label class=\"so-field\"><span>最多重试次数</span><input id=\"so-diag-retry-count\" type=\"number\" step=\"1\" min=\"1\" max=\"99\"></label>\\n            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-retry-empty\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>空白回复（模型没返回内容）</span></label>\\n            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-retry-format\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>格式错误（没能读懂 / 拒收模型给的更新）</span></label>\\n            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-retry-error\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>调用失败（网络错误 / 超时等）</span></label>\\n            </div>": "<label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-auto\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> automatically diagnoses each new reply (automatically checks and repairs in the background MVU) </span></label>\\n <div class=\"so-hint\"> Every time it receives a new AI reply, it checks the variable updates in the background, automatically fixes the problem if it is found, and leaves a revocable record in the diagnosis record. It still works even if the window is closed - the diagnostic button turns red to indicate it is running in the background. Each reply will send an additional model request. </div>\\n <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-mvu-compat\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>⏳ Compatible with MVU \"Extra Model Analysis\" </span></label>\\n <div class=\"so-hint\"> is only checked when using automatic diagnosis and the \"Extra Model Analysis\" of TavernHelper / MVU at the same time. Each AI reply first observes the 4 second start window; once external parsing is started, it will wait for the complete retry batch to end. If the update block is successfully written, it will be verified; if it fails or there is no valid update block, it will be deduced by automatic diagnosis as usual. If you wait up to 10 minutes and it is not completed yet, this round will be skipped safely and there will be no rush to write. If auto-correction is also enabled, it will share this wait and merge the update block before updating swipe. </div>\\n <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-cowrite\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> 🧩 Allows co-writing with other scripts MVU</span></label>\\n <div class=\"so-hint\"> Certain card scripts/extensions will overwrite MVU during diagnostics. After checking, automatic diagnosis will still be executed, but only unmodified values ​​will be written, and modified values ​​will be skipped and not written. </div>\\n <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-retry\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>🔁 Automatically retry if failed </span></label>\\n <div class=\"so-hint\"> automatically diagnoses and automatically tries again when this round is not completed (each retry will re-read the current status and send a model request again). Check below which failure situations need to be retried; success, no changes required, and safe skip (cut chat/status changed/manual interruption) never retry. </div>\\n <div id=\"so-diag-retry-opts\">\\n <label class=\"so-field\"><span> Maximum number of retries </span><input id=\"so-diag-retry-count\" type=\"number\" step=\"1\" min=\"1\" max=\"99\"></label>\\n <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-retry-empty\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Blank reply (no content returned by the model) </span></label>\\n <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-retry-format\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Format error (failed to understand/rejected updates from the model) </span></label>\\n <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-retry-error\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> call failed (network error/timeout, etc.) </span></label>\\n </div>",
