+  "\n            <div id=\"so-diag-wisel\">\n            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-usesel\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>诊断使用精选世界书条目（关闭则用默认扫描）</span></label>\n            <div class=\"so-hint\">开启后可【按本聊天】挑选要喂给诊断的世界书条目，无视其在 ST 里的启用 / 禁用状态——解决「禁用了变量规则条目后诊断就看不到」与「全量太吵」的两难。首次开启会按当前激活情况预选一份，之后随你增删、按聊天记忆。</div>\n            <div id=\"so-diag-picker\">\n                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-hybrid\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>混合模式：精选条目 + 主聊天当前触发的绿灯条目</span></label>\n                <div class=\"so-lb-row\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-book so-lb-icon\"></i>\n                    <select id=\"so-diag-book\" title=\"选择要从哪本世界书里挑条目\"></select>\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-diag-refresh\" title=\"刷新世界书列表\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-right\"></i></div>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"so-diag-entries\" class=\"so-lb-entries\">\n                    <div class=\"so-lb-entries-head\">\n                        <span id=\"so-diag-entries-summary\">条目：全部</span>\n                        <div class=\"so-iconbtn so-lb-ent-toggle\" id=\"so-diag-entries-toggle\" title=\"展开 / 折叠条目列表\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-down\"></i></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"so-lb-entries-tools\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini\" id=\"so-diag-all\">全选</button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini\" id=\"so-diag-none\">全不选</button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini\" id=\"so-diag-filtered\" disabled title=\"只选中当前筛选 / 搜索结果里的条目（先在下方筛选框输入关键词）\">全选筛选</button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini so-lb-mini-blue\" id=\"so-diag-blue\" title=\"只选常驻（蓝灯）条目，不含已禁用\">仅蓝灯</button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini so-lb-mini-green\" id=\"so-diag-green\" title=\"只选关键词触发（绿灯）条目，不含已禁用\">仅绿灯</button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini so-lb-mini-off\" id=\"so-diag-disabled\" title=\"只选已禁用条目\">仅禁用</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"so-diag-entries-filter\" class=\"so-lb-entries-filter\" placeholder=\"筛选条目（标题 / 关键词 / uid）…\">\n                    <div id=\"so-diag-entries-list\" class=\"so-lb-entries-list\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"so-hint\" id=\"so-diag-hint\"></div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-fix-bar\">\n            <details class=\"so-mode-collapse\" id=\"so-fix-collapse\" open>\n                <summary class=\"so-mode-collapse-sum\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles\"></i><span>校正设置</span></summary>\n                <div class=\"so-mode-collapse-body\">\n                    <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span>校正模式</span>&nbsp;<select id=\"so-fix-mode-select\" title=\"手动 = 在输入框直接说要改什么（单稿、快）；去 AI 味 = 按目标去八股 / 每条新回复后台跑（双稿收紧）\"><option value=\"manual\">手动（说要改哪里）</option><option value=\"auto\">去 AI 味（按目标 / 每条新回复）</option>": "\n            <div id=\"so-diag-wisel\">\n            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-usesel\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Diagnosis using selected World Info entries (default scan if turned off) </span></label>\n            After <div class=\"so-hint\"> is turned on, you can 【 click on this chat 】 to select the World Info entry to be fed to the diagnosis, regardless of its enabled/disabled status in ST - solving the dilemma of \"the diagnosis cannot be seen after the variable rule entry is disabled\" and \"the full amount is too noisy\". When you open it for the first time, one will be pre-selected according to the current activation status, and then you can add or delete it according to the chat memory. </div>\n            <div id=\"so-diag-picker\">\n                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-diag-hybrid\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Mixed mode: featured entries + main chat currently triggered green light entries </span></label>\n                <div class=\"so-lb-row\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-book so-lb-icon\"></i>\n                    <select id=\"so-diag-book\" title=\"Select which World Info to choose from\"></select>\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-diag-refresh\" title=\"Refresh World Info List\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-right\"></i></div>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"so-diag-entries\" class=\"so-lb-entries\">\n                    <div class=\"so-lb-entries-head\">\n                        <span id=\"so-diag-entries-summary\"> entries: All </span>\n                        <div class=\"so-iconbtn so-lb-ent-toggle\" id=\"so-diag-entries-toggle\" title=\"Expand/collapse entry list\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-down\"></i></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"so-lb-entries-tools\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini\" id=\"so-diag-all\"> select all </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini\" id=\"so-diag-none\"> does not select </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini\" id=\"so-diag-filtered\" disabled title=\"Select only the entries in the current filter/search results (first enter keywords in the filter box below)\">Select all to filter </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini so-lb-mini-blue\" id=\"so-diag-blue\" title=\"Only select resident (blue light) entries, excluding disabled\">Blue light only </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini so-lb-mini-green\" id=\"so-diag-green\" title=\"Only select keyword trigger (green light) entries, excluding disabled ones\">Only green light </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-lb-mini so-lb-mini-off\" id=\"so-diag-disabled\" title=\"Select only disabled entries\">Disable only </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"so-diag-entries-filter\" class=\"so-lb-entries-filter\" placeholder=\"Filter entries (title/keyword/uid)…\">\n                    <div id=\"so-diag-entries-list\" class=\"so-lb-entries-list\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"so-hint\" id=\"so-diag-hint\"></div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-fix-bar\">\n            <details class=\"so-mode-collapse\" id=\"so-fix-collapse\" open>\n                <summary class=\"so-mode-collapse-sum\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles\"></i><span> Correction settings </span></summary>\n                <div class=\"so-mode-collapse-body\">\n                    <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span> Correction mode </span>&nbsp;<select id=\"so-fix-mode-select\" title=\"Manual = Directly say what you want to change in the input box (single draft, quick); go to AI flavor = remove stereotypes according to the target / Run in the background for each new reply (double draft tightening)\"><option value=\"manual\"> manual (say where to change) </option><option value=\"auto\"> go to AI flavor (by target/each new reply) </option>",
