+  "</select></label>\n                    <!-- ✨ 判定预览行（1.18.0 迁出 #so-fix-auto-wrap，修 P8）：本聊天开了自动校正就该看得见\n                         「这条回复会被怎么处理」，不再被「面板正显示手动视图」这个全局偏好埋没。 -->\n                    <div id=\"so-fix-verdict\" class=\"so-fix-verdict\" hidden></div>\n\n                    <!-- 手动模式：在下方输入框直接说要改什么。默认带上丰富上下文（一次性精修、质量优先）。单稿、无目标。 -->\n                    <div id=\"so-fix-manual\">\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-preset\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>经自定义补全预设发送（破限 / 越狱用）</span></label>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint\">仅当模型拒绝校正请求时才开（需先在【设置】里精选一个补全预设）。</div>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint so-fixm-warn\">⚠ 部分模型（如 DeepSeek、Gemini）在高上下文下会认不准要改哪一条回复、把前文内容混进结果——下面几项默认关闭，仅在确有需要（对齐设定 / 前情）时再逐项开启。若确要带前文，更建议改用 ✂️ 选段校正：只把你划选的一段发给模型，高上下文下更稳，也绝不动没划到的部分。</div>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span>加载前文条数（-1 = 全部）</span>&nbsp;<input id=\"so-fixm-depth\" type=\"number\" min=\"-1\" max=\"100\" style=\"width:64px;\"></label>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-card\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>带上角色卡（描述 / 性格 / 场景）</span></label>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-world\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>带上当前激活世界书</span></label>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-summary\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>带上 📜剧情概要</span></label>\n                        <!-- ✨ 思考块保护（W1 2026-08-16 §3.1 修复）。文案待 Prince 过目（行文案 + title 候选见 REPORT-FIXROUND） -->\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-protectthink\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>保护思考区块（&lt;think&gt; 思维链等，校正时原样保留）</span></label>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint\">部分模型改整条回复时会顺手把卡片的思考区块整块删掉——开着时系统先把它收走、校正后原样接回（校正卡会注明）。想让校正连思考块一起改时再关。</div>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span>校正回复上限</span>&nbsp;<input id=\"so-fix-maxtok\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1024\" style=\"width:6em\" placeholder=\"自动·4096\" title=\"校正调用的 max_tokens 下限自动为 4096；长楼层（约 3000 字以上）改写被截断、校正总失败时可调高（如 8192/12288）。对手动与自动校正都生效。注意：超过服务商单次输出上限会被直接拒绝——报错就调回来。留空 = 自动。\"></label>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint\">手动：在下方输入框直接说要改哪里（如「换种写法重写这段」「她这里不该笑」），只改最新这一条回复，单稿、更快。</div>\n                        ": "</select></label>\n                    <!-- ✨ Judgment preview line (1.18.0 moved out #so-fix-auto-wrap, repaired P8): this chat should be visible if automatic correction is turned on\n                         \"How will this reply be processed?\" is no longer buried under the global preference of \"Panel is showing manual view\". -->\n                    <div id=\"so-fix-verdict\" class=\"so-fix-verdict\" hidden></div>\n\n                    <!-- Manual mode: Just say what you want to change in the input box below. Rich context is provided by default (one-time refinement, quality first). Single draft, no goal. -->\n                    <div id=\"so-fix-manual\">\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-preset\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> is sent by custom completion default (for breaking restrictions/jailbreak) </span></label>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint\"> is only enabled when the model rejects the correction request (you need to first select a completion preset in 【 settings 】). </div>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint so-fixm-warn\">⚠ Some models (such as DeepSeek, Gemini) will not be sure which reply to change under high context, and the previous content will be mixed into the results - the following items are turned off by default, and will only be turned on one by one when necessary (alignment settings/previous context). If you really want to bring the previous text, it is recommended to use ✂️ Segment correction: only send the selected section to the model, which is more stable under high context, and never touch the unselected section. </div>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span> Number of articles before loading (-1 = all) </span>&nbsp;<input id=\"so-fixm-depth\" type=\"number\" min=\"-1\" max=\"100\" style=\"width:64px;\"></label>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-card\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Bring character card (description/character/scene) </span></label>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-world\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Bring the currently activated World Info </span></label>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-summary\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Bring it 📜Plot summary </span></label>\n                        <!-- ✨ Think block protection (W1 2026-08-16 §3.1 fixes). Copywriting is waiting for Prince to review (copywriting + title candidate, please see REPORT-FIXROUND) -->\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixm-protectthink\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Protect the thinking block (&lt;think&gt; thinking chain, etc., remain intact during correction) </span></label>\n                        When some <div class=\"so-hint\"> models modify a reply, they will delete the whole thinking block of the card - when it is on, the system will take it away first, then correct it and then put it back as it is (the correction card will indicate this). Turn off the correction if you want to modify it together with the thinking block. </div>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span>校正回复上限</span>&nbsp;<input id=\"so-fix-maxtok\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1024\" style=\"width:6em\" placeholder=\"自动·4096\" title=\"校正调用的 max_tokens 下限自动为 4096；长楼层（约 3000 字以上）改写被截断、校正总失败时可调高（如 8192/12288）。对手动与自动校正都生效。注意：超过服务商单次输出上限会被直接拒绝——报错就调回来。留空 = 自动。\"></label>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint\"> Manual: Directly say what you want to change in the input box below (such as \"Rewrite this paragraph in a different way\" \"She shouldn't laugh here\"), only change the latest reply, single draft, faster. </div>\n                        ",
+  "<button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fixsel-open\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\" title=\"划选回复里的一段，只把这段发给模型改——弱模型 / 长聊天下更稳，绝不动你没选的部分（状态栏 / 面板等）\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-scissors\"></i> 选段校正（只改划选的一段）</button>": "<button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fixsel-open\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\" title=\"Select a paragraph in the reply and only send this paragraph to the model for modification - weak model/more stable in long chats, never touch the parts you did not select (status bar/panel, etc.)\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-scissors\"></i> Segment correction (only the selected segment is corrected) </button>",
+  "<label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixsel-barbtn\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>在聊天输入框上方放一个「✂️ 选段校正」快捷按钮</span></label><div class=\"so-hint\">免去每次开窗切模式：在主聊天里划选一段，点它即可直接打开选段卡（不划选 = 直接开卡）。</div><label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixsel-rowbtn\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>在最新一条 AI 回复的右上角放「✂️」选段按钮</span></label><div class=\"so-hint\">不想看到回复上的小剪刀就取消勾选；输入框上方的快捷按钮不受影响。</div>": "<label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixsel-barbtn\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Place a \"✂️ Selection Correction\" shortcut button above the chat input box </span></label><div class=\"so-hint\"> to avoid opening the window and switching modes every time: select a segment in the main chat, click it to directly open the segment card (no selection = open the card directly). </div><label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixsel-rowbtn\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Place the \"✂️\" selection button in the upper right corner of the latest reply AI </span></label><div class=\"so-hint\"> If you don't want to see the scissors on the reply, uncheck it; the shortcut button above the input box will not be affected. </div>",
+  "\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- 自动模式（1.18.3 新手优先重排）：判定行 → 跑一次 / 每条 → 目标 → 强度 → 警告盒 → 进阶折叠 → 恢复推荐。 -->\n                    <div id=\"so-fix-auto-wrap\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-run\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles\"></i> 按目标给最新回复去 AI 味</button>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-auto\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>每条新回复自动去 AI 味</span></label>\n                        <div class=\"so-fix-targets-head\">校正目标</div>\n                        <div class=\"so-fix-tgt-grid\">\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-slop\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>AI 八股 / 套话</span></label>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-dialogue\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>对话机械 / 不自然</span></label>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-precision\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>过度精确（数学论文腔）</span></label>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-magic\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>魔法被写成理科（仅奇幻设定）</span></label>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-pacing\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>描写拖沓 / 流水账</span></label>\n                        </div>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span>强度</span>&nbsp;<select id=\"so-fix-prompt-version\" title=\"轻校＝现行提示词（较克制）；精校＝更彻底的三道工序校正\"><option value=\"light\">轻校（默认）</option><option value=\"thorough\">精校（更彻底）</option></select></label>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\" id=\"so-fix-prompt-flavor-row\"><span>精校侧重</span>&nbsp;<select id=\"so-fix-prompt-flavor\" title=\"按你用的模型选侧重：DeepSeek / 国产模型选 DeepSeek 类；Claude / Opus 选 Opus 类；Gemini 选 Gemini 类\"><option value=\"deepseek\">DeepSeek 类（默认）</option><option value=\"opus\">Opus 类</option><option value=\"gemini\">Gemini 类</option></select></label>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint\">轻校 = 克制（默认）。精校 = 更彻底的三道工序；按你用的模型选侧重：DeepSeek / 国产模型选「DeepSeek 类」，Claude / Opus 选「Opus 类」，Gemini 选「Gemini 类」。</div>\n                        <div id=\"so-fix-warnings\" class=\"so-hint\" hidden></div>\n                        <details class=\"so-mode-collapse\" id=\"so-fix-adv\">\n                            <summary class=\"so-fix-targets-head\" style=\"cursor:pointer;\">进阶设置（一般不用动）</summary>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span>只校正此标签内的正文</span>&nbsp;<input id=\"so-fix-scope\" type=\"text\" style=\"width:110px;\"></label>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\">通常不用动：会自动识别卡片的正文标签（默认 <code>content</code>），认不准时会请你确认一次。识别错了才在这里改（<strong>手填后自动识别会停用</strong>，交还给你）；<strong>留空</strong> = 校正整条回复。</div>\n                            <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-scan\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass\"></i> 重新扫描正文标签（识别不对时用）</button>\n                            <div id=\"so-fix-scan-panel\" class=\"so-fix-scan-panel\" hidden></div>\n                            <div class=\"so-fix-targets-head\">保留区 / 丢弃区：结构块会自动识别并原样保留——下面是<strong>本条回复</strong>实际识别到的。没认出的块，点它加进保留区（或手动填，每行一个<strong>起始</strong>标记；支持嵌套同名标签与 <code>[IMG_GEN]</code> 方括号块）；丢弃区 = 直接删掉、不放回。识别不对的格式欢迎在 Discord 私信 <strong>@Prince</strong>，会加进测试集修复。标签写法：&lt;thinking&gt; 或 thinking 都行，不用写闭合标签；方括号块写 [IMG_GEN]；同一标签两边都填按保留处理。</div>\n                            <div id=\"so-fix-receipts\" class=\"so-hint\" hidden></div>\n                            <textarea id=\"so-fix-keep\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"保留区标签：每行一个，只写开标签或名字即可——例如 <status> 或 status（不用写 </status>）；方括号块写 [IMG_GEN]\"></textarea>\n                            <textarea id=\"so-fix-drop\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"丢弃区标签：每行一个，只写开标签或名字即可——例如 <thinking>（不用写 </thinking>）；方括号块写 [IMG_GEN]。命中的块直接删掉、不放回\"></textarea>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-join\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>整体校正（默认开）：正文合并为 1 次调用，结构块用锚点原位保留</span></label>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\">开 = 省调用、整篇更连贯；结构块位置靠锚点标记保留（模型极偶尔挪动锚点时内容不丢、位置兜底接到正文末尾，记录里会如实说明）。关 = 每段正文各发一次调用（位置由代码百分百把控、单段失败只损失那一段，调用更多）。</div>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-wait-mvu\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>⏳ 与 MVU「额外模型更新」并用（避免抢写冲突）</span></label>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\">仅当你开了 MVU 的「额外模型更新」（用另一个模型异步解析变量）时才勾。勾上后：校正<strong>照常立刻开跑</strong>（与 MVU 并行、几乎不多等），只在<strong>生成新回复稿之前</strong>等 MVU 把变量写完再合并进来——两者不再抢写同一条消息、数据不错乱。没开额外模型更新就<strong>保持不勾</strong>。</div>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixa-preset\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>经自定义补全预设发送（破限 / 越狱用）</span></label>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\">⚠ 仅在你的模型 / 中转会【拒绝】校正请求、需要破限 / 越狱时才开。需先在【设置】里选好并「精选」一个补全预设。手动与自动【各自独立】开关；开启的那一套会套上该预设的文本块与角色（跳过角色卡 / 世界书等 RP 内容标记），可能更慢 / 更贵。不需要破限就别开。</div>\n                            <textarea id=\"so-fix-know\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"角色知识边界（可空）：例如「主角不知道自己的真实身世」\"></textarea>\n                            <textarea id=\"so-fix-guard\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"剧情护栏 / 自定义（可空）：例如「保持慢热，不要时间跳跃」\"></textarea>\n                            <details class=\"so-mode-collapse\" id=\"so-fix-ctx-adv\">\n                                <summary class=\"so-fix-targets-head\" style=\"cursor:pointer;\">上下文（默认关，点开）</summary>\n                                <div class=\"so-hint\">⚠ 默认关闭以省时间。仅当你的「知识边界 / 剧情护栏」需要参考前文 / 角色卡 / 世界书才能判断时，才勾选。</div>\n                                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-card\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>带上角色卡（描述 / 性格 / 场景）</span></label>\n                                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-ctx\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>带上前文上下文（最近若干条主聊天）</span></label>\n                                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\" style=\"margin-left:18px;\"><span>条数（-1=全部）</span>&nbsp;<input id=\"so-fix-ctx-depth\" type=\"number\" min=\"-1\" max=\"100\" style=\"width:64px;\"></label>\n                                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-world\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>带上激活世界书（蓝灯 + 本条命中的绿灯）</span></label>\n                                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixa-summary\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>带上 📜剧情概要</span></label>\n                            </details>\n                            <div class=\"so-fix-bundle-row\">\n                                <select id=\"so-fix-bundle\" title=\"已存的校正套餐（全局，跨聊天可用）\"></select>\n                                <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-bundle-load\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\">加载</button>\n                                <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-bundle-save\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\">保存为…</button>\n                                <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-bundle-del\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\">删除</button>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\">套餐＝把当前这套自动校正配置（目标 / 约束 / 上下文）存成一个名字（如「硬核西幻」），换聊天后一键加载回来。</div>\n                        </details>\n                        <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-reset\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> 恢复推荐设置</button>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint\">把本聊天的自动校正设置一键还原成推荐值：作用域 = <code>content</code>、默认校正目标、排除区清空、自动关、任务切回校正（也会清掉已确认的正文形态，回到自动识别）。</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    ": "\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Automatic mode (1.18.3 novice priority rearrangement): Judgment line → Run once / each → Target → Strength → Warning box → Advanced folding → Restore recommendation. -->\n                    <div id=\"so-fix-auto-wrap\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-run\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles\"></i> Go to AI to give the latest reply according to the target </button>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-auto\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Each new reply automatically goes to AI Wei </span></label>\n                        <div class=\"so-fix-targets-head\"> correction target </div>\n                        <div class=\"so-fix-tgt-grid\">\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-slop\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>AI Eight-gut / Rhetoric </span></label>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-dialogue\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Dialogue Machine / Unnatural </span></label>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-precision\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Overly precise (mathematical paper cavity) </span></label>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-magic\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Magic is written as science (fantasy setting only) </span></label>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-tgt-pacing\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>Description procrastination / running account</span></label>\n                        </div>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span> Strength</span>&nbsp;<select id=\"so-fix-prompt-version\" title=\"Light correction = current prompt word (more restrained); fine correction = more thorough three-step correction\"><option value=\"light\"> light correction (default) </option><option value=\"thorough\"> fine correction (more thorough) </option></select></label>\n                        <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\" id=\"so-fix-prompt-flavor-row\"><span> fine calibration focuses on </span>&nbsp;<select id=\"so-fix-prompt-flavor\" title=\"Choose the focus according to the model you use: DeepSeek / domestic model choose DeepSeek type; Claude / Opus choose Opus class; Gemini select Gemini class\"><option value=\"deepseek\">DeepSeek class (default) </option><option value=\"opus\">Opus class </option><option value=\"gemini\">Gemini class </option></select></label>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint\"> light correction = restraint (default). Fine calibration = more thorough three-step process; choose the focus according to the model you are using: For DeepSeek / domestic model, choose \"DeepSeek type\", for Claude / Opus, choose \"Opus type\", and for Gemini, choose \"Gemini type\". </div>\n                        <div id=\"so-fix-warnings\" class=\"so-hint\" hidden></div>\n                        <details class=\"so-mode-collapse\" id=\"so-fix-adv\">\n                            <summary class=\"so-fix-targets-head\" style=\"cursor:pointer;\"> advanced settings (generally do not need to be touched) </summary>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><span>Only correct the text in this label</span>&nbsp;<input id=\"so-fix-scope\" type=\"text\" style=\"width:110px;\"></label>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\"> usually does not need to be touched: it will automatically recognize the text label of the card (default <code>content</code>). If it is not correct, it will ask you to confirm it once. If the recognition is wrong, correct it here (after filling in <strong> by hand, automatic recognition will deactivate </strong> and return it to you); leave <strong> blank and </strong> = correct the entire reply. </div>\n                            <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-scan\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass\"></i> Rescan the text label (used when the recognition is incorrect) </button>\n                            <div id=\"so-fix-scan-panel\" class=\"so-fix-scan-panel\" hidden></div>\n                            <div class=\"so-fix-targets-head\"> reserved area/discarded area: The structural blocks will be automatically recognized and retained as they are - the following is what </strong> actually recognized in this article's reply. For unrecognized blocks, click on it and add it to the reserved area (or fill it in manually, with one <strong> starting </strong> tag per line; supporting nested labels with the same name and <code>[IMG_GEN]</code> square bracket blocks); discard area = delete directly and not put back. If the format is incorrectly recognized, please send a private message to Discord at <strong>@Prince</strong>, and it will be added to the test set for repair. How to write the label: &lt;thinking&gt; or thinking; no need to write a closed label; write [IMG_GEN] in the square bracket block; fill in both sides of the same label and keep it. </div>\n                            <div id=\"so-fix-receipts\" class=\"so-hint\" hidden></div>\n                            <textarea id=\"so-fix-keep\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Reserved area labels: one per line, just write the label or name - such as <status> or status (no need to write </status>); write [IMG_GEN]\"></textarea> in square brackets\n                            <textarea id=\"so-fix-drop\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Discard area label: one per line, just write the opening label or name - for example, <thinking> (no need to write </thinking>); write [IMG_GEN] in the square bracket block. The hit block is directly deleted and not replaced\"></textarea>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-join\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> overall correction (default on): the main text is merged into 1 calls, and the structure block is retained in place with anchor points </span></label>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\"> on = saves calls and the whole article is more coherent; the position of the structure block is retained by the anchor point mark (the model rarely moves the anchor point without losing the content, and the position is transferred to the end of the text, and the record will explain it truthfully). Off = one call is issued for each paragraph of text (the position is 100% controlled by the code, if a single paragraph fails, only that paragraph will be lost, and more calls will be made). </div>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-wait-mvu\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>⏳ Use together with MVU \"Extra Model Update\" (to avoid write rush conflicts) </span></label>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\"> is only checked if you turn on MVU's \"Extra Model Update\" (asynchronous parsing of variables with another model). After ticking: Calibrate <strong> and start running </strong> immediately as usual (in parallel with MVU, almost no more), only before <strong> generates a new reply draft, </strong> waits for MVU to finish writing the variables and then merge them in - the two no longer rush to write the same message, and the data is not messed up. If no additional model update is enabled, <strong> will remain unchecked and </strong> will remain unchecked. </div>\n                            <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixa-preset\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> is sent by custom completion default (for breaking restrictions/jailbreak) </span></label>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\">⚠ Only open when your model/transfer 【 rejects 】 correction request and needs to break the limit/jailbreak. You need to first select and \"select\" a completion preset in 【 settings 】. Manual and automatic 【 have independent 】 switches; the set that is turned on will apply the preset text blocks and characters (skipping character cards/World Infos and other RP content markers), which may be slower/more expensive. Don't open it if you don't need to break the limit. </div>\n                            <textarea id=\"so-fix-know\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Character knowledge boundary (can be empty): For example, \"The protagonist does not know his true life experience\"\"></textarea>\n                            <textarea id=\"so-fix-guard\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Plot guardrails / Custom (optional): For example, \"Keep it slow, don't jump in time\"\"></textarea>\n                            <details class=\"so-mode-collapse\" id=\"so-fix-ctx-adv\">\n                                <summary class=\"so-fix-targets-head\" style=\"cursor:pointer;\"> context (default off, click on) </summary>\n                                <div class=\"so-hint\">⚠ is turned off by default to save time. Only check if your \"knowledge boundary/plot guardrail\" needs to be judged by referring to the previous article/character card/World Info. </div>\n                                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-card\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Bring character card (description / personality / scene) </span></label>\n                                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-ctx\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Bring the previous context (several recent main chats) </span></label>\n                                Number of <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\" style=\"margin-left:18px;\"><span> (-1=all) </span>&nbsp;<input id=\"so-fix-ctx-depth\" type=\"number\" min=\"-1\" max=\"100\" style=\"width:64px;\"></label>\n                                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fix-world\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Bring the activated World Info (blue light + green light in this article) </span></label>\n                                <label class=\"so-check so-lb-check\"><input id=\"so-fixa-summary\" type=\"checkbox\"><span> Bring it 📜Plot summary </span></label>\n                            </details>\n                            <div class=\"so-fix-bundle-row\">\n                                <select id=\"so-fix-bundle\" title=\"Saved correction package (global, available across chats)\"></select>\n                                <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-bundle-load\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\"> loads </button>\n                                <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-bundle-save\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\"> saved as…</button>\n                                <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-bundle-del\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\"> delete </button>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"so-hint\"> package = save the current automatic correction configuration (target/constraint/context) under a name (such as \"Hardcore Western Fantasy\"), and load it back with one click after changing the chat. </div>\n                        </details>\n                        <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fix-reset\" class=\"so-fix-run-btn\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> Restore recommended settings </button>\n                        <div class=\"so-hint\"> restores the automatic correction settings of this chat to the recommended values with one click: scope = <code>content</code>, default correction target, clear exclusion area, auto-off, task switch back to correction (it will also clear the confirmed text form and return to automatic recognition). </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    ",
