uck/waiting too long)\" style=\"display:none\">Cancel </button>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-plan-mini\" id=\"so-arc-live\" title=\"Open a floating window to see the real-time output of the model - confirm whether it is streaming or really stuck\" style=\"display:none\">📡 Real time output </button>\n            </div>\n            <pre id=\"so-plan-directive\"></pre>\n            <div id=\"so-plan-editwrap\" style=\"display:none\">\n                <textarea id=\"so-plan-editbox\" rows=\"9\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea>\n                <div class=\"so-plan-actions\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-plan-mini so-plan-done\" id=\"so-plan-edit-save\">Save </button>\n                    <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-plan-mini\" id=\"so-plan-edit-cancel\">Cancel</button>\n                    <span class=\"so-plan-spacer\"></span>\n                    <button type=\"button\" class=\"so-plan-mini\" id=\"so-plan-edit-reset\" title=\"Discard the customization and return to the injection content automatically generated according to the scheme\">Restore the default </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            ",
+  "\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-messages\"></div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-footer\">\n            <textarea id=\"so-input\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"就当前剧情提问…（Enter 发送，Shift+Enter 换行）\"></textarea>\n            <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-send\" title=\"发送\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-paper-plane\"></i></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-debug\">\n            <div id=\"so-debug-head\">\n                <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-bug\"></i> 上一次发送的提示词 <span id=\"so-debug-meta\"></span></span>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;gap:2px;\">\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-debug-copy\" title=\"复制完整提示词\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-copy\"></i></div>\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-debug-close\" title=\"关闭\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <pre id=\"so-debug-body\"></pre>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-summary\">\n            <div id=\"so-summary-head\">\n                <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-scroll\"></i> 剧情概要（本聊天）</span>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;gap:2px;\">\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-summary-clear\" title=\"清空概要\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash-can\"></i></div>\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-summary-close\" title=\"关闭\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"so-summary-sub\">粘贴你的运行总结 / 前情提要（比如存在补全预设或别处、神谕本来读不到的剧情梗概）。它随【本聊天】保存，并在【普通聊天】与【剧情参谋】模式下插入到最近对话记录的正前方。留空即不启用。</div>\n            <textarea id=\"so-summary-text\" placeholder=\"在此粘贴剧情概要 / 前情提要…\"></textarea>\n            <div id=\"so-summary-foot\"><span id=\"so-summary-count\"></span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-autowarn\">\n            <div id=\"so-autowarn-card\">\n                <div id=\"so-autowarn-head\"><span class=\"so-warn-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\"></i> 开启自动诊断模式？</span><div class=\"so-iconbtn so-warn-x\" title=\"关闭\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div></div>\n                <div id=\"so-autowarn-body\">\n                    <p>开启后，每当主聊天收到一条新的 AI 回复，故事神谕都会在后台自动处理它的 MVU 变量，并<strong>自动应用</strong>（无需点击确认，每次都会弹出可撤销提示；窗口关着也照常工作）：</p>\n                    <p>· 回复里<strong>带有</strong> &lt;UpdateVariable&gt; 更新 → 核验并修正它；<br>· 回复里<strong>没有</strong>更新区块 → 直接据剧情<strong>推导</strong>出本回合应有的变量更新并补上。</p>\n                    <p>因此它既能<strong>替代</strong> MVU 的「额外模型解析」，也能在需要时与它配合：外部解析成功后做核验，外部解析失败 / 没有写出有效更新块时接手推导。</p>\n                    <p class=\"so-autowarn-danger\">⚠ 若要与「额外模型解析」<strong>同时</strong>使用，请在诊断设置里勾选「⏳ 兼容 MVU『额外模型解析』」。兼容开关会识别完整重试批次并在写入前协调自动校正；不勾时仍按普通自动诊断时序运行，可能与外部解析抢写。</p>\n                    <p class=\"so-autowarn-note\">自动模式每条回复都会多发一次模型请求，会额外消耗 token。</p>\n                </div>\n                <label class=\"so-autowarn-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"so-autowarn-never\"><span>不再提示</span></label>\n                <div id=\"so-autowarn-btns\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-autowarn-cancel\">取消</button>\n                    <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-autowarn-ok\">开启自动模式</button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-fixwarn\">\n            <div id=\"so-fixwarn-card\">\n                <div id=\"so-fixwarn-head\"><span class=\"so-warn-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-info\"></i> ✨ 自动校正：一键去 AI 味</span><div class=\"so-iconbtn so-warn-x\" title=\"关闭\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div></div>\n                <div id=\"so-fixwarn-body\">\n                    <p>「自动校正」会把回复里的<strong>故事正文</strong>重写得更像人写的——去 AI 八股 / 套话、让对白自然、收紧读感——并作为<strong>新的一条 swipe</strong> 放进来：原回复永远留在左滑，随时能滑回去，<strong>不破坏存档</strong>。</p>\n                    <p class=\"so-autowarn-danger\"><strong>常见的卡片格式会自动识别</strong>：正文在哪、状态栏 / 选项菜单 / 面板 / 图生指令这些结构块该原样保留，通常不用你设置；认不准时它会<strong>问你一次</strong>（面板出现「✋ 需要确认」点一下就好）。</p>\n                    <p>格式特别的卡可能有漏网。遇到识别不对：打开「进阶设置」可以看到<strong>这条回复实际识别到了哪些结构块</strong>，没认出的块点一下（或手动填）加进保留区就行；也欢迎<strong>把那条回复原文在 Discord 私信发给作者 @Prince</strong>——这种格式会加进测试集，之后的版本就能自动认出。</p>\n                    <p>面板顶部的<strong>判定行</strong>随时告诉你：最新这条回复会被怎么处理（校正哪几段、保留多少块、还是跳过）。</p>\n                    <p>校正只改文字表达：<strong>不</strong>翻译、<strong>不</strong>改设定、<strong>不</strong>算数值、<strong>不</strong>修卡片本身的问题。</p>\n                    <p class=\"so-autowarn-note\">成本：开「每条新回复自动去 AI 味」后每条回复多发一次模型请求；很短 / 很干净的回复自动跳过。只想偶尔用，就用「按目标给最新回复去 AI 味」，点一次跑一次。</p>\n                </div>\n                <label class=\"so-autowarn-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"so-fixwarn-never\"><span>不再提示</span></label>\n                <div id=\"so-fixwarn-btns\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fixwarn-ok\">知道了</button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"so-resize-grip\" title=\"拖动调整大小\" aria-label=\"调整窗口大小\"></div>\n    ": "\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-messages\"></div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-footer\">\n            <textarea id=\"so-input\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Ask a question about the current plot... (Enter sends, Shift+Enter breaks)\"></textarea>\n            <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-send\" title=\"Send\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-paper-plane\"></i></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-debug\">\n            <div id=\"so-debug-head\">\n                <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-bug\"></i> Last sent prompt word <span id=\"so-debug-meta\"></span></span>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;gap:2px;\">\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-debug-copy\" title=\"Copy the complete prompt word\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-copy\"></i></div>\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-debug-close\" title=\"Close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <pre id=\"so-debug-body\"></pre>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-summary\">\n            <div id=\"so-summary-head\">\n                <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-scroll\"></i> Plot summary (this chat) </span>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;gap:2px;\">\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-summary-clear\" title=\"Clear Summary\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash-can\"></i></div>\n                    <div class=\"so-iconbtn\" id=\"so-summary-close\" title=\"Close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"so-summary-sub\"> Paste your running summary/preliminary summary (for example, if there is a completion default or a plot summary elsewhere or that the oracle cannot read originally). It is saved with 【 this chat 】 and inserted right in front of the recent conversation record in 【 normal chat 】 and 【 plot consultant 】 modes. Leave blank to disable. </div>\n            <textarea id=\"so-summary-text\" placeholder=\"Paste plot summary/previous summary here...\"></textarea>\n            <div id=\"so-summary-foot\"><span id=\"so-summary-count\"></span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-autowarn\">\n            <div id=\"so-autowarn-card\">\n                <div id=\"so-autowarn-head\"><span class=\"so-warn-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\"></i> Turn on automatic diagnosis mode? </span><div class=\"so-iconbtn so-warn-x\" title=\"Close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div></div>\n                <div id=\"so-autowarn-body\">\n                    After <p> is turned on, every time the main chat receives a new AI reply, Story Oracle will automatically process its MVU variable in the background and <strong> automatically apply </strong> (no need to click to confirm, an undoable prompt will pop up every time; the window will work as usual even if the window is closed): </p>\n                    <p>· <strong> in the reply has </strong> &lt;UpdateVariable&gt; update → Verify and correct it; <br>· <strong> in the reply does not have the </strong> update block → Directly deduce </strong> from the plot <strong> to update the variables that should be used in this round and make up for it. </p>\n                    <p> can therefore not only replace the \"extra model parsing\" of </strong> MVU with <strong>, but can also cooperate with it when needed: do verification after the external parsing succeeds, and take over the derivation when the external parsing fails/no valid update block is written. </p>\n                    <p class=\"so-autowarn-danger\">⚠ If you want to use </strong> with \"Extra Model Analysis\" <strong>, please check \"⏳ Compatible with MVU \"Extra Model Analysis\"\" in the diagnostic settings. The compatibility switch will identify the complete retry batch and coordinate automatic correction before writing; when it is not checked, it will still run according to the normal automatic diagnosis sequence, and may compete with external analysis for writing. </p>\n                    <p class=\"so-autowarn-note\"> automatic mode will send an additional model request for each reply, which will consume additional token. </p>\n                </div>\n                <label class=\"so-autowarn-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"so-autowarn-never\"><span> no longer prompts </span></label>\n                <div id=\"so-autowarn-btns\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-autowarn-cancel\">Cancel</button>\n                    <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-autowarn-ok\"> turns on automatic mode </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div id=\"so-fixwarn\">\n            <div id=\"so-fixwarn-card\">\n                <div id=\"so-fixwarn-head\"><span class=\"so-warn-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-info\"></i> ✨ Automatic correction: one click to go to AI taste </span><div class=\"so-iconbtn so-warn-x\" title=\"Close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div></div>\n                <div id=\"so-fixwarn-body\">\n                    <p> \"Automatic correction\" will rewrite the <strong> story text in the reply to make it more human-written - remove AI stereotypes/clichés, make the dialogue natural, and tighten the reading sense - and put it in as a new one for <strong> swipe</strong>: the original reply will always remain in the left swipe, and can be swiped back at any time, <strong> will not destroy the archive </strong>. </p>\n                    <p class=\"so-autowarn-danger\"><strong> Common card formats will automatically recognize </strong>: where is the text, status bar/option menu/panel/picture command and other structural blocks should be left as they are, usually without you setting them; if you are not sure, it will <strong> ask you once (just click on \"✋ Need to confirm\" on the panel). </p>\n                    Cards with a special <p> format may be missed. If you encounter a recognition error: Open \"Advanced Settings\" and you can see which structural blocks </strong> actually recognized by <strong>'s reply. Just click on the unrecognized blocks (or fill them in manually) and add them to the reserved area; <strong> is also welcome to send the original text of the reply to the author @Discord in a private message to @Prince</strong> - this format will be added to the test set, and subsequent versions will automatically recognize it. </p>\n                    The <strong> judgment line </strong> at the top of the <p> panel tells you at any time: how the latest reply will be processed (which paragraphs will be corrected, how many blocks will be retained, or skipped). </p>\n                    <p> correction only changes the text expression: <strong> does not </strong> translate, <strong> does not </strong> change settings, <strong> does not </strong> arithmetic values, <strong> does not </strong> repairs the card itself. </p>\n                    <p class=\"so-autowarn-note\"> cost: After turning on \"Automatically de-flavor every new reply\", one more model request will be sent for each reply; very short/very clean replies will be automatically skipped. If you only want to use it occasionally, just use \"Remove the AI flavor to the latest reply by target\" and click once to run. </p>\n                </div>\n                <label class=\"so-autowarn-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"so-fixwarn-never\"><span> no longer prompts </span></label>\n                <div id=\"so-fixwarn-btns\">\n                    <button type=\"button\" id=\"so-fixwarn-ok\"> got it</button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"so-resize-grip\" title=\"Drag to resize\" aria-label=\"Resize window\"></div>\n    ",
