+  "找找条目之间有没有矛盾。": "Look for any inconsistencies between entries.",
+  "一起构思剧情接下来怎么走。": "Let’s figure out how the plot will go next.",
+  "接下来剧情可以怎么走？给我几个方向。": "Where can the plot go next? Give me some directions.",
+  "基于现在的局势，提一个值得推进的转折。": "Based on the current situation, propose a turning point worth advancing.",
+  "手动：在下方输入框直接说要改哪里，只改这一条回复（快、单稿）。<br>自动：每条新回复后台自动清 AI 味——「校正设置」切到「去 AI 味」、开「每条新回复自动去 AI 味」。": "Manual: Directly say what you want to change in the input box below, and only change this reply (quick, single draft). <br> Automatic: Automatically clear AI flavor for each new reply in the background - \"Calibration Settings\" switch to \"Remove AI Flavor\" and turn on \"Automatically remove AI Flavor for Every New Reply\".",
+  "校正只去 AI 腔 / 收紧读感——不翻译、不改设定、不算数值、不修卡片本身的问题。": "The correction only removes the AI accent/tightens the reading sense - does not translate, does not change the settings, does not count the values, and does not correct the card itself.",
+  "这个角色不该知道这件事，重写他的对话": "The character shouldn't know this, rewrite his dialogue",
+  "这个事件的日期不对，回看上下文改正": "The date of this event is incorrect. Please review the context and correct it.",
+  "这个角色的台词太机械，重写得更像真人": "This character's lines are too robotic and should be rewritten to look more like real people",
+  "扩写这一段，补充更多剧情细节": "Expand this paragraph and add more plot details",
+  "一起打造一个立得住的角色。": "Together we create a character that stands up.",
+  "先聊清楚是谁、什么样，再一键锻造成稿；写入前都只是草稿。": "First, let’s talk clearly about who and what it is, and then create a draft with one click; before writing, it’s just a draft.",
+  "帮我完善我当前的角色。": "Help me perfect my current role.",
+  "我想造一个全新的 NPC。": "I want to build a brand new NPC.",
+  "把剧情里出现过的那个角色写成世界书条目。": "Write a World Info entry for the character who appears in the plot.",
