+  "已返回世界书模式。": "Returned to World Info mode.",
+  "已返回角色工坊模式。": "Returned to character workshop mode.",
+  "诊断模式已开启。我会把最新一条 AI 回复中的变量更新，对照本角色卡的 MVU 规则与当前状态进行检查，然后给出一份你可以一键应用的纠正补丁。可以让我检查它、指出哪里看起来不对，或者直接说“审计整个状态”。要让它每条回复都自动跑，在下方「诊断设置」里勾上「自动诊断每条新回复」。": "Diagnostic mode is on. I'll update the variables in the latest AI reply, check this character card's MVU rules against the current status, and then come up with a corrective patch you can apply with one click. You can ask me to review it, point out what doesn't look right, or just say \"audit the entire state.\" To have it run automatically for every reply, check \"Automatically diagnose every new reply\" in the \"Diagnosis Settings\" below.",
+  "已返回普通聊天模式。⚠ 自动诊断仍在后台运行（诊断按钮保持红色）——要停掉它，回到诊断模式取消勾选「自动诊断每条新回复」。": "Returned to normal chat mode. ⚠ Automatic diagnosis is still running in the background (the Diagnosis button remains red) - to stop it, go back to diagnostic mode and uncheck \"Automatically diagnose every new reply\".",
+  "🔴 自动诊断已开启。此后每当主聊天收到新的 AI 回复，我都会在后台自动检查其中的 MVU 变量更新，发现问题就【自动应用修复】，并在这里留一条可撤销的记录。窗口关着也照常工作。": "🔴 Automatic diagnosis is on. After that, whenever the main chat receives a new AI reply, I will automatically check the MVU variable update in the background. If there is a problem, 【 will automatically apply the fix 】, and leave a revocable record here. Works as usual even with the window closed.",
+  "自动诊断已关闭。手动诊断不受影响——你仍可以随时在这里让我检查最新一条回复。": "Automatic diagnostics are turned off. Manual diagnostics are not affected - you can still ask me to check the latest reply here at any time.",
+  "诊断模式（点一下开 / 关这一房）—— 🔴 自动诊断正在后台运行：要停掉它，在诊断设置里取消勾选": "Diagnostic mode (one click to turn this room on/off) - 🔴 Automatic diagnosis is running in the background: to stop it, uncheck it in the diagnostic settings",
+  "诊断模式 —— 修复 MVU 状态变量（自动诊断在诊断设置里勾选开启）": "Diagnostic mode - fix MVU status variable (automatic diagnosis is checked in the diagnostic settings)",
+  "校正模式 · 自动校正已开，但这张卡的正文形态还需你确认一次 —— 点下一条回复弹出的确认提示（或「校正设置」判定行的「确认」），之后每条回复才会自动校正": "Correction mode · Automatic correction is on, but the text form of this card still needs to be confirmed by you - click the confirmation prompt that pops up for the next reply (or \"Confirm\" in the judgment line of \"Correction Settings\"), and then each reply will be automatically corrected",
+  "校正模式 · 自动校正已开启（金色）—— 每条新回复都会自动校正（在校正模式设置里关闭）": "Correction Mode · Auto-correction on (gold) – every new reply is automatically corrected (turn off in Correction Mode settings)",
+  "校正模式 —— 修一修最新这条回复（AI 味 / 对话 / 设定 / 详略…），应用后原文仍在": "Correction mode - fix the latest reply (AI flavor / dialogue / settings / details...), the original text remains after application",
+  "世界书模式已开启。我已读取选定世界书的全部条目——你可以问里面写了什么、找矛盾、聊扩写思路；也可以让我改写、新增或删除条目，我会给出一份你能一键应用（并可撤销）的改动。上方可切换要处理哪一本。": "World Info mode is on. I have read all the entries in the selected World Info - you can ask what is written in it, find contradictions, and discuss expansion ideas; you can also ask me to rewrite, add or delete entries, and I will give you a copy of the changes that you can apply (and undo) with one click. You can switch which book to process at the top.",
+  "校正模式已开启。我会读取最新一条 AI 回复，按你说的把它改一版——你想怎么改都行：重写某段、改语气、调节奏、删减、改掉某个设定或不合适的描写……任何要求都可以。直接说你想改什么，我给出一份可一键应用的校正稿（应用后原文仍在，左滑即可看回）。": "Calibration mode is on. I'll read the latest AI reply and revise it as you asked - whatever you want: rewrite a paragraph, change the tone, adjust the pacing, delete, remove a setting or inappropriate description... whatever you want. Just tell me what you want to change, and I will give you a correction draft that can be applied with one click (the original text will still be there after application, and you can view it by swiping left).",
+  "角色工坊已开启。先在下方设置里选好打造目标（用户角色·抢话 / 用户角色·不抢话 / NPC 条目），告诉我你想打造谁——我会先问清楚，再一键锻造成稿。": "The character workshop has been opened. First select the creation target in the settings below (User role·Talk grabbing/User role·Not grabbing talk/NPC entry) and tell me who you want to build - I will ask clearly first and then forge the draft with one click.",
