+  "工坊锻造": "Workshop forging",
+  "(空回复) — 多半是「最大 token 数」太小、被工序的 <thinking> 思考占满了。到设置里调大它，再点一次「🔨 生成」。": "(Empty reply) — Most likely the \"maximum number of token\" is too small and is occupied by <thinking> considerations of the process. Go to settings, increase it, and click \"🔨 Generate\" again.",
+  "锻造给的是补丁，但找不到要改的条目——让访谈师在汇总里带上 uid 或准确的条目标题": "Forge provided a patch, but could not find the item to be changed - ask the interviewer to include uid or the exact item title in the summary",
