+  "【结构块保留】这条回复里可能夹着非叙事的结构块——状态栏、[方括号]标记、HTML / XML 区块、选项菜单、": "【 structure blocks reserved 】 This reply may contain non-narrative structure blocks - status bar, [square bracket] mark, HTML / XML block, option menu,",
+  "图片生成提示等。默认把它们连同内部内容【原样逐字保留】，不要改写、精简、翻译或删除，也不要改动其位置。": "Image generation tips, etc. The default is to keep them, along with their internal content 【, verbatim 】, without rewriting, streamlining, translating or deleting, or changing their location.",
+  "【例外·用户指令优先】若用户的修改要求明确指向某个结构块内部的内容，则以用户要求为准、按要求改那一处；": "【 Exception·User instructions take precedence 】 If the user's modification request clearly points to the content inside a certain structure block, the user's request shall prevail and that part shall be modified according to the request;",
