+  "\\n\\n【保留区锚点】<text_to_transform> 里形如 ⟦SO_KEEP_数字⟧ 的标记是系统占位锚点（用户「保留区」的内容已被抽走，稍后会按标记位置原样接回）：必须【原样保留、留在它出现的位置】，绝不改写、移动、合并或删除——它不是要校正的内容；正文其余照常校正。": "\\n\\n【 reserved area anchor point 】<text_to_transform> has the shape of ⟦SO_KEEP_ number⟧ The mark is the system placeholder anchor point (the content of the user's \"reserved area\" has been removed and will be returned as it is at the marked position later): it must be retained as it is and left in the position where it appears. It must not be rewritten, moved, merged or deleted - it is not the content to be corrected; the rest of the text must be corrected as usual.",
+  "【自动诊断模式 —— 重要】这是一次后台自动诊断，时机是一条新 AI 回复刚到。这条回复的正文里【带有】一个变量更新区块，但那个区块【没有生效】——它的格式坏了（缺闭合标签／写法引擎不认／指令本身落不了地），变量引擎这一回合一条指令都没有执行，当前状态【尚未】包含这条回复带来的变化。请你充当变量更新引擎——通读这段回复，依角色卡 MVU 规则与当前状态，重新推导出本回合【应当】发生的全部变量更新（好感度增减、物品获得 / 消耗、时间推进、地点 / 状态变化……），生成 <UpdateVariable> 补丁把状态更新到这条回复之后的正确值。\\n": "【 automatic diagnosis mode - Important 】 This is a background automatic diagnosis, the timing is a new one AI The reply just arrived. In the text of this reply, 【 contains a variable update block 】, but that block 【 does not take effect 】 - its format is broken (missing the closing tag/the writing engine does not recognize it/the command itself cannot be landed), the variable engine has not executed a single instruction this round, and the current state 【 has not yet included the changes brought about by this reply. Please act as a variable update engine - read this reply thoroughly, and according to the rules and current status of the character card MVU, re-deduce all the variable updates that occurred in 【 and 】 in this round (favorability increase or decrease, item acquisition/consumption, time advancement, location/status changes...), and generate a <UpdateVariable> patch to update the status to the correct value after this reply. \\n",
+  "正文里那段坏掉的区块可以当【线索】参考（它写了什么、想改哪些字段），但不要照抄它的路径与写法——以剧情里确凿发生的事、以及当前状态里真实存在的字段为准，绝不脑补没写的细节。\\n": "The broken block in the main text can be used as a reference for the clue 【 】 (what it says and which fields you want to change), but don’t copy its path and writing method—based on what actually happened in the plot and the fields that really exist in the current state, never fill in the details that you didn’t write. \\n",
+  "遵循下方输出规则；确实没有任何变量需要变动时，输出空的 JSONPatch（[]）。": "Follow the output rules below; when there is really no variable that needs to be changed, output an empty JSONPatch ([]).",
+  "【自动诊断模式 —— 重要】这是一次后台自动诊断，时机是一条新 AI 回复刚到，而这条回复的正文里【没有】任何变量更新区块：说明本回合的变量更新【还没有】被写入，当前状态【尚未】包含这条回复带来的变化。请你充当变量更新引擎——通读这段回复，依角色卡 MVU 规则与当前状态，推导出本回合【应当】发生的全部变量更新（好感度增减、物品获得 / 消耗、时间推进、地点 / 状态变化……），生成 <UpdateVariable> 补丁把状态更新到这条回复之后的正确值。只依据回复里确凿发生的事，绝不脑补没写的细节。\\n": "【 automatic diagnosis mode - Important 】 This is a background automatic diagnosis, the timing is a new one AI The reply has just arrived, and there is no 】 variable update block in the text of this reply: it means that the variable update 【 of this round has not been written yet, and the current status 【 has not yet 】 included the changes brought about by this reply. Please act as a variable update engine - read this reply thoroughly, and according to the rules and current status of the character card MVU, deduce all the variable updates that occurred to 【 and 】 in this round (favorability increase or decrease, item acquisition/consumption, time advancement, location/status changes...), and generate a <UpdateVariable> patch to update the status to the correct value after this reply. Only rely on what actually happened in the reply and never fill in the details that were not written. \\n",
+  "【自动诊断模式 —— 重要】这是一次后台自动诊断。这条 AI 回复【自带】变量更新，且它【已经生效】——当前状态就是该更新应用之后的结果。你的任务只是【核验并最小化修正】它（仍以当前状态为事实依据）。\\n": "【 automatic diagnosis mode - Important 】 This is a background automatic diagnosis. This AI reply 【 comes with the 】 variable update, and it 【 has taken effect 】 - the current status is the result after the update is applied. Your task is just to verify and minimize it (still based on the current status). \\n",
+  "【绝对不要】把这回合的变化重新推导、重新计算一遍：那些增减（花掉的钱、涨的好感度、推进的时间……）都已经算进当前状态了，再补一次就会把同一笔算两遍。只在当前状态里能指出【具体错值】时才出补丁。\\n": "【 absolutely do not want 】 to re-deduce and recalculate the changes in this round: those increases and decreases (money spent, increased favorability, time to advance...) have already been included in the current state, and if you make up for it again, the same amount will be counted twice. A patch will only be released when the specific error value of 【, 】, can be pointed out in the current state. \\n",
