+  "(空回复) — 审计可能把 token 预算用光了（推理也算在内）。调大设置里的「最大 token 数」，或问得更聚焦一点（比如只审某一类变量）。": "(empty reply) — The audit probably blew out the token budget (reasoning also counts). Increase the \"maximum number of token\" in the settings, or ask a more focused question (for example, only review a certain type of variable).",
+  "(空回复) — 端点收下了请求，但没有返回正文。常见三因：\\n": "(Empty reply) — The endpoint accepted the request but did not return any text. Three common causes: \\n",
+  "① 「最大 token 数」太小，或被模型思考占满 → 到设置里调大它再试。\\n": "① The \"Maximum number of token\" is too small, or it is occupied by model thinking → go to the settings and increase it and try again. \\n",
+  "② 触发了 Gemini 安全过滤 → 换个说法，或开破限 / 换个模型再试。\\n": "② Gemini security filtering is triggered → Change the term, or break the limit/change the model and try again. \\n",
+  "③ 公益站 PvP": "③ Charity station PvP",
